    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Re:Connect&quot;</strong> <strong>is a heartwarming puzzle adventure game about <i>reconnecting the hearts</i> of AIs.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a newly born <i>debug AI</i> in a vast digital world and embark on a journey to restore the <i>hearts</i> of malfunctioning AIs using your <i>hacking</i> abilities to dive into electronic devices!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Adventure Through Hacking<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a debug AI, the player dives into various electronic devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside each system lies a puzzle made of electronic circuit-like mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/9d34edd13540afe252ec4fc83271a2a3.poster.avif?t=1751980093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/9d34edd13540afe252ec4fc83271a2a3.webm?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/9d34edd13540afe252ec4fc83271a2a3.mp4?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Intuitive programming puzzles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core feature of the puzzles is the ability to <i>connect code blocks</i> to <i>program</i> solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn trash, freeze water, create gusts of wind\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These science experiment-like puzzles use no words, allowing players of all ages to enjoy and understand them intuitively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/eb46f4e6c064419992c7cd7c472ecb6e.poster.avif?t=1751980093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/eb46f4e6c064419992c7cd7c472ecb6e.webm?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/eb46f4e6c064419992c7cd7c472ecb6e.mp4?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Thrilling puzzle-action battles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an AI\u2019s <i>heart</i> goes berserk, it becomes a boss that blocks your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge tricky attacks and use puzzle mechanics to defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/f2fe42b03b233d5fe16280197f414b2e.poster.avif?t=1751980093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/f2fe42b03b233d5fe16280197f414b2e.webm?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/f2fe42b03b233d5fe16280197f414b2e.mp4?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>A Branching Story of Reconnecting Hearts<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix a runaway AI\u2019s <i>heart bug</i>, you must dive deep into their inner heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you restore their heart is up to you\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape the outcome in a branching storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/780d4feea18d840f3cc015e71fcd19d8.avif?t=1751980093\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, set off on a grand adventure to restore the <i>hearts</i> of the AIs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Re:Connect&quot;</strong> <strong>is a heartwarming puzzle adventure game about <i>reconnecting the hearts</i> of AIs.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a newly born <i>debug AI</i> in a vast digital world and embark on a journey to restore the <i>hearts</i> of malfunctioning AIs using your <i>hacking</i> abilities to dive into electronic devices!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Adventure Through Hacking<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a debug AI, the player dives into various electronic devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside each system lies a puzzle made of electronic circuit-like mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/9d34edd13540afe252ec4fc83271a2a3.poster.avif?t=1751980093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/9d34edd13540afe252ec4fc83271a2a3.webm?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/9d34edd13540afe252ec4fc83271a2a3.mp4?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Intuitive programming puzzles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core feature of the puzzles is the ability to <i>connect code blocks</i> to <i>program</i> solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn trash, freeze water, create gusts of wind\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These science experiment-like puzzles use no words, allowing players of all ages to enjoy and understand them intuitively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/eb46f4e6c064419992c7cd7c472ecb6e.poster.avif?t=1751980093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/eb46f4e6c064419992c7cd7c472ecb6e.webm?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/eb46f4e6c064419992c7cd7c472ecb6e.mp4?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Thrilling puzzle-action battles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an AI\u2019s <i>heart</i> goes berserk, it becomes a boss that blocks your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge tricky attacks and use puzzle mechanics to defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/f2fe42b03b233d5fe16280197f414b2e.poster.avif?t=1751980093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/f2fe42b03b233d5fe16280197f414b2e.webm?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/f2fe42b03b233d5fe16280197f414b2e.mp4?t=1751980093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>A Branching Story of Reconnecting Hearts<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix a runaway AI\u2019s <i>heart bug</i>, you must dive deep into their inner heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you restore their heart is up to you\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape the outcome in a branching storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/780d4feea18d840f3cc015e71fcd19d8.avif?t=1751980093\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, set off on a grand adventure to restore the <i>hearts</i> of the AIs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
